# Rust build artifacts. A bare `target/` matches at any depth: the workspace
# root's target and each member crate's, because a command run from inside a
# crate (a test writing frames, say) creates `crates/<name>/target` as well.
target/

# Local/generated files
*.log
.DS_Store

# Visual Studio's per-solution state. It reappears whenever the folder is opened
# in VS, and none of it belongs in the repository.
.vs/


